    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Windows 95, Netscape’s stock-market debut and Disney’s expansion made technology and entertainment exciting news.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "The chosen chip and software shares gained much more than the broad basket in this window. They still had difficult months, and their results do not describe every technology company.",
    "what_faded_away": "The launch-day buzz did not tell you the size of five-year gains. New leadership and big deals were plans whose results still had to unfold.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "Nobody knew the exact path or the final ranking. Stopping the chart in August 2000 leaves later events outside the result.",
